WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Hodomoe City, Isshu Region

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:30.000
Satoshi and Go have arrived to investigate a rumor
of a newly-discovered Pokémon. However...

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:32.880
I-It wasn’t true?!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:39.450
Th-Then what about that newly-discovered
evolution of Gear, Gegegegegegegegegegear?

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.640
Just a funny joke I came up with
to advertise this shop.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.020
But what about these
sketches from eyewitnesses?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:49.070
Yeah, I drew those too.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.840
Well then, how about some
life-sized Gear Cookies? An Isshu specialty!

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.280
Why not buy some as a souvenir?

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:03.030
Why didn’t you check
if it was real?

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:05.530
We came all the way
to Isshu for this.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.970
Well, I just saw it
on the news, meow.

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:10.400
<i>You’re</i> the one who said
we should go, meow.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.840
Come on, just drop it already...

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:16.510
I wanted to catch that
Gegegegegegegegegear...

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:19.100
That’s too many “Ge”s, meow.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.180
It’s Gegegegegegegegegear, meow.

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:23.890
No! It’s
Gegegegegegegegegegegear!

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:25.630
It’s Gegegegegegegegegear, meow!

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:27.060
Is not!

00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:31.200
Does it matter?
It was just a hoax anyway!

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:37.480
Wow, Hodomoe City Market
was amazing!

00:01:38.870 --> 00:01:42.240
Huh? Your investigation’s
over already?

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:44.930
Yeah...

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.080
How was your shopping?

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.730
All done!
I bought all sorts of things.

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:51.250
She’s the only one
who had any luck...

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:53.590
Did something happen?

00:01:53.950 --> 00:01:55.630
Come on...

00:01:56.610 --> 00:01:59.080
Ooh! Hey, look over there!

00:01:59.080 --> 00:02:00.770
It’s the brat boys!

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:02.960
You really think I’d believe...

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:04.350
They are!

00:02:04.350 --> 00:02:07.850
No time for arguing.
Let’s catch Pikachu, meow!

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.560
These Gear Cookies really are tasty!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:54.630
That’s right!
I came all this way to buy these cookies.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:55.690
One hundred percent came all this way
to buy these cookies.

00:03:55.690 --> 00:03:57.540
He’s trying to convince himself...
One hundred percent came all this way
to buy these cookies.

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:57.550
He’s trying to convince himself...

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.670
I... came here...
to buy... these cookies.

00:04:00.140 --> 00:04:01.380
What’s wrong, Sarunori?

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:05.690
What is that?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:08.210
Building works?
No, it couldn’t be...

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.770
Looks pretty deep...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.230
Eevee, no!

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:14.710
Sarunori!

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.230
Eevee!

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.980
We’ve gotta go after them.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:19.980
Yeah.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:20.820
Let’s hurry!

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.710
They went down there.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.110
Think you can escape us?

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:32.670
After them!

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:33.410
Hold on!

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.720
Wouldn’t it be better
to ambush them here?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.830
Huh?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:40.420
I’ve got it!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.360
Sonansu, you stay here
and keep watch, meow.
Sonansu—

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.110
Sonansu, you stay here
and keep watch, meow.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:44.730
If Pikachu pops out, then—

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.290
Catch it with that!

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.850
We’ll hunt them down!

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:50.730
Yeah!

00:04:51.330 --> 00:04:52.810
Wait for me, meow!

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.690
Eevee!
Sarunori!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.190
Down this way!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:10.280
There!

00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:12.590
What a relief!

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:15.450
What <i>is</i> this hole...?

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.410
It’s like a maze down here...

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:20.340
Looks like they don’t
suspect a thing.

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:22.100
Time to catch him!

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.670
Hyper Catching Machine, activate!

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:26.680
Huh?

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:30.050
You broke that machine
when you stepped on it, meow.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:30.860
What?!

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.760
Didn’t I tell you to fix it?!

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:34.580
Now how are we
supposed to catch him?!

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:36.080
This is your fault, meow!

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:37.400
How’s it my fault?!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:38.380
What?!

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.720
Come on, stop fighting...

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:46.140
Morpeko?!

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:48.370
Looks like it went straight
to hungry, meow!

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:51.150
Shush!
They’ll spot us if we’re too loud!

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:52.950
Who’ll spot you, now?

00:05:54.970 --> 00:05:57.370
Why are you three here?

00:05:57.370 --> 00:05:59.280
You’re plotting something again,
aren’t you?

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.340
See? We got spotted!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:02.800
In that case...

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.260
We’ll have to take him by force!

00:06:06.890 --> 00:06:08.330
Watch out, Pikachu!

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:10.890
Eevee, where are you?

00:06:11.420 --> 00:06:12.790
There’s too much smoke!

00:06:12.790 --> 00:06:15.690
Let’s just grab Pikachu
and get out of here!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.560
Stay with me, Sarunori!

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.880
I bumped into something, meow...

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.840
What was that for...?

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.150
Pikachu... Are you okay?

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.240
Morpeko?!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.800
We did it! Pikachu’s ours!

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.560
That went well.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.050
Ack!

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:44.210
That’s not Pikachu!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:46.170
What a mess...

00:06:46.910 --> 00:06:49.300
Where did Sarunori go?

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.680
I lost track of everyone else, too...

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.260
Eevee!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.790
Looks like it’s not here, meow.

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.940
Nyarth?

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:16.620
Hey! Go! Koharu! Pikachu!

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:20.080
This place really is a maze...

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.880
Where’d everyone go?

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:24.750
Morpeko, you have any idea?

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:29.230
You’re hungry again?!

00:07:29.230 --> 00:07:32.240
I <i>just</i> gave you some
Gear Cookies!

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.510
Okay...

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.520
But just one.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:44.150
I’ll be in trouble
if I run out of cookies...

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.140
Another fork...

00:07:48.140 --> 00:07:50.410
Do I try going left this time?

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.400
Pikachu, make sure you stick...

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.140
Huh?

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.160
Pikachu?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.410
Pikachu!

00:07:59.050 --> 00:08:00.730
Stop, Pikachu!

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:05.290
Stop it. If you just pick at random,
you’re going to get lost.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.980
Uhh... How did I get here?

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:13.630
I think I went left, left, then right...

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.390
I told you, stop!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.720
Huh? Something stinks...

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.540
Eevee! If you can hear me,
say something!

00:08:28.910 --> 00:08:30.520
Why are you following me?

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:33.380
This is the only path.
What else am I supposed to do, meow?

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:38.700
Hey... Team Rocket take Pokémon
from people, don’t they?

00:08:39.110 --> 00:08:40.940
Why do you do that?

00:08:40.940 --> 00:08:45.750
It’s our duty as the evil organization
known as Team Rocket, meow!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.960
A-Are you okay?

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.330
Oh, you’re covered in dirt.

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.790
Hold still.

00:08:55.770 --> 00:08:58.040
Th-Thank you, meow.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:00.550
She’s kind, meow...

00:09:00.550 --> 00:09:02.990
Worlds apart from Musashi, meow...

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.710
Can you smell something?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.690
Yeah...

00:09:08.890 --> 00:09:09.940
Look out!

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.970
Are you okay, meow?

00:09:22.970 --> 00:09:25.230
Th-Thank you.

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.850
He saved me?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:30.960
Maybe he’s not that bad after all...

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:37.950
No Pikachu, no brat boys,
and we can’t even find our way out.

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.570
Hey, you.
Any idea how to get out of here?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.800
No idea what you just said!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.480
If only Nyarth was here...

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:48.270
Who cares?

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.560
Not like having Nyarth here
would change anything.

00:09:51.560 --> 00:09:54.190
Don’t say that.
He’s part of our team.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:59.070
Hey, since we’re stuck with it anyway,
why don’t we just get Eevee to join Team Rocket?

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:04.680
Yeah... If we do that,
we could even have it spy on the brat boys.

00:10:04.680 --> 00:10:06.450
Yeah, that’s a great idea!

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:08.290
That decided...

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:15.050
Time for a crash course on all it needs to know
to be part of Team Rocket!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:31.850
I wonder if Sarunori is with anyone...

00:10:31.850 --> 00:10:36.430
It <i>was</i> Team Rocket’s...
What if they’ve caught it again by now...?

00:10:41.310 --> 00:10:42.850
Sewers?

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:45.790
So that’s what the smell was...

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:49.700
If there’s sewers,
they must connect to the surface.

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.030
So then...

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:53.390
Again?

00:10:53.390 --> 00:10:55.390
Wait for me, Pikachu!

00:10:57.250 --> 00:11:00.240
You need to stop and think
before you act!

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.480
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.080
What’s that...?

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:33.820
Gamageroge! Vibration Pokémon!
Water/Ground type!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:38.210
The vibrating of the bumps all over its body
causes earthquake-like tremors!

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.420
Okay...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.930
Pikachu! Iron—

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.570
Pikachu!

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:55.730
No!

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:58.140
Electric moves don’t work
on Gamageroge!

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.240
Use Iron Tail!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:10.050
All right, good work!
Now’s my chance to catch it!

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:20.290
O-Oh...

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.810
You can’t do that, Pikachu...

00:12:25.620 --> 00:12:28.630
This feeling of having
someone else take the lead...

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.850
It reminds me of...

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:33.650
Now I get it,
you’re just like Satoshi!

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:38.270
Pokémon really do
take after their trainers...

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.900
I told you that you
can’t eat them all!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.820
I’m starving, too!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:47.870
Well, if that’s how you wanna do it...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.540
I’ll just have to eat them first!

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:55.540
How come you know how to talk?

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:57.510
Well...

00:12:57.510 --> 00:13:01.790
I learned how to for this girl I liked
a long time ago, meow...

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:06.490
Really?
What sort of girls do you like?

00:13:06.490 --> 00:13:11.790
I... I like k-kind girls, meow.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.270
You do?

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:18.480
But if you want people to be kind to you,
you should be kind to them first.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:20.980
Y-You think so...?

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.460
Hey, Nyarth...
Why don’t you stop doing bad things?

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.550
Wha—?!

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:29.110
Oh, wait...
You’ve been caught by Team Rocket...

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.600
Not the case, meow.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:31.950
Huh? Really?

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.280
But you’re friends, right?

00:13:34.280 --> 00:13:36.160
Not anymore, meow!

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:40.960
Musashi’s selfish and she never treats Pokémon well.
She’s awful, meow!

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.090
You can’t say that.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:46.790
You shouldn’t speak ill of others,
no matter how bad they are.

00:13:46.790 --> 00:13:49.790
If you’ve had a fight,
you need to make peace with her!

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.570
She’s dazzling me, meow...

00:13:54.570 --> 00:13:55.820
I’ve made up my mind, meow.

00:13:55.820 --> 00:14:01.110
I’m leaving Team Rocket
and letting her catch me, meow.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:02.860
Musashi!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:04.030
Kojiro!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.770
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:10.750
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:13.180
Just kidding, meow!

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.450
Okay, pause!

00:14:14.450 --> 00:14:18.380
So, you do the
“Just kidding, meow!” bit.

00:14:18.380 --> 00:14:22.130
The introduction scene is the best time
for righteous evil to shine.

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.030
The timing is the key!

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:27.100
Okay then, time for a rehearsal!

00:14:27.690 --> 00:14:28.430
Musashi!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.340
Kojiro!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:33.460
The Team Rocket duo
soars through the galaxy!

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.440
Like a white hole,
a white tomorrow awaits us!

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.360
That was great!

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.780
Are you sure about this?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.290
Replacing Nyarth with an Eevee...

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.120
It’s fine!

00:14:50.120 --> 00:14:53.120
Now, one more rehearsal,
li’l Eevee!

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.080
Someone’s there!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:42.750
It could be Satoshi!
Let’s go!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:56.750
Iront! Iron Ant Pokémon!
Bug/Steel type!

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:59.520
They have steel armor
and large mandibles!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:03.730
They dig maze-like nests
and group together to protect themselves!

00:16:04.320 --> 00:16:06.980
So this hole was an Iront’s nest...

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.640
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:18.490
That’s not good!

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:21.000
Run for it!

00:16:25.300 --> 00:16:27.650
You’re not getting these!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:31.550
Iront...

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.780
Hey, take a look around!

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.640
We don’t have time for this...

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:37.710
This thing...

00:16:38.270 --> 00:16:39.220
Oh, I know!

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:43.560
I’m not gonna feed ya!
Bleh-bleh-bleh!

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:53.600
Ouch...

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.490
That worked!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.740
Run while we can!

00:16:58.510 --> 00:17:00.740
That’s a pretty stone, meow...

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.150
I’ll give her this and tell her
how I feel, meow!

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:06.800
Ahem...!

00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:07.880
What is it?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:12.950
P-Please be—

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.310
What are those things?!

00:17:22.410 --> 00:17:23.600
Let’s just run for it!

00:17:58.890 --> 00:17:59.830
Go! Pikachu!
Satoshi!

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:00.640
Go! Pikachu!

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.390
Koharu! ...and Nyarth?!

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:05.320
The brat boy...!

00:18:05.320 --> 00:18:06.290
The brat boy<i>s...!</i>

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:07.390
Eevee!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.310
What a relief...

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.660
If that was me, meow...

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.470
So you were okay.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:16.430
I mean,
not like it matters to me.

00:18:16.430 --> 00:18:17.350
Come on...

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:18.910
Right back at ya, meow!

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.390
Huh? Where’s Sarunori?

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.570
We’ll just have to fight them off...

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.890
Let’s go, Pikachu!

00:18:36.860 --> 00:18:39.700
Sarunori, where did you go...?

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:46.100
Sarunori!

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:46.930
And...

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.100
Sonansu?

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:51.440
What’s that?!

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:56.230
Kuitaran! Anteater Pokémon!
Fire type!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:59.810
Using their flaming tongues,
they burn through Iront’s bodies and consume them!

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:02.030
Iront is their prey!

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:12.100
Hey!

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:14.120
Wouldn’t this be a good time
to get away?

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.220
Yeah!

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.300
We should run, too!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:35.070
We’re finally safe...

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:38.510
Huh? Why is an Iront here?

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.450
Did you run away?

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.320
I get it...
Then why not come with me?

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.830
Monster Ball, go!

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.970
Iront’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:05.050
I caught Iront!

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:10.410
Huh? Where’d you learn that?

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:14.370
This is gonna be my only chance
to tell her, meow!

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:19.670
I-I love you, meow!

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:23.040
Please be my friend, meow!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.450
Wh-What is this all of a sudden?

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:31.470
Sheesh! We’ve always been a team!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.670
Yeah. We have!

00:20:35.100 --> 00:20:37.830
U-Uh... That wasn’t...

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.210
I’m glad you managed
to make up with her!

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:47.740
Wh-What?!

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:51.260
Oh, right!
That thing was super hungry!

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:52.600
Where’s the cookies...?

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.510
Huh?

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:54.750
I must’ve dropped ‘em.

00:20:55.740 --> 00:20:57.790
Kojiro, do something!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:20:58.850
R-Right...

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.060
Morpeko, retur—

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.650
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:15.500
That was rough, but fun!

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:16.430
Yeah.

00:21:16.430 --> 00:21:18.710
I even caught an Iront!

00:21:19.990 --> 00:21:24.970
Satoshi, Go, and Koharu got tangled up in
unexpected trouble.

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:29.720
Perhaps reuniting with their partners
has brought them a little closer.

00:21:40.970 --> 00:21:43.410
She was lovely, meow...

00:23:07.130 --> 00:23:09.590
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.590 --> 00:23:10.820
Go!

00:23:11.440 --> 00:23:15.790
Six Tairetsu work together as a perfect team
to form one Pokémon.

00:23:15.790 --> 00:23:19.530
But doesn’t something about
that Tairetsu look weird to you?

00:23:19.530 --> 00:23:20.960
Hey, you should go back.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.340
You’re only a Tairetsu when
six of you are together, right?

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:28.320
Who’s that Pokémon?!

00:23:29.410 --> 00:23:31.350
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.350 --> 00:23:34.510
Commander Pikachu!
Head Forth, Tairetsu!!
